      "type": "rich-text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "",
        "title_size": 56,
        "title_width": 12,
        "heading_h1": false,
        "text": "<p>In warm and humid settings, bacteria, viruses, dust mites, and mold flourish and proliferate, causing harm to surfaces and shortening their lifespan. To address this issue, MEDIFLEX incorporates an integrated hygiene feature that provides a solution. It effectively protects the surfaces, ensuring they remain free from unpleasant odors and unwantedguests. Say goodbye to worries and embrace acleaner, fresher living environment with MEDIFLEX.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/anti-microbial-and-anti-fungal-fabrics3.png",
        "image_width": 600,
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "secondary",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "enlarge_text": false,
        "full_width": false,
        "no_padding_bottom": true,
        "color_scheme": "standard",
        "color_bg": "",
        "color_text": ""
      }
