        "title": "10 YEAR WARRANTY",
        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p>MEDIFLEX is renowned for its remarkable longevity, exemplifying true quality. With its robust and durable nature, it surpasses the demands of the medical field, making constant replacements unnecessary. To further instill confidence in its reliability, MEDIFLEX comes with a remarkable 10-year warranty, ensuring peace of mind for its users.<br/></p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "text_width": 50,
        "button_style": "link",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/coated-fabrics-for-medical-upholstery.jpg",
